<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Chun Wo shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Chun Wo shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday afternoon it had suspended trading in shares of construction firm Chun Wo Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>The company's shares jumped HK$1.00 or 44 percent to HK$3.275 before trading was suspended.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
